        "auth:a": "[{\"id\":\"c2\",\"user\":\"\",\"salt\":\"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\",\"hash\":\"347a985ec7168356313c41db6be8a43bbf49dc635408e87dc538020b81310acf\"}]"
      }
    },
    "events": [
      {
